    rdfs:label "Candidate dataset: Rothemund, Papadakis, and Winfree 2004, Algorithmic self-assembly of DNA Sierpinski triangles" ;
    dct:description "experimental demonstration that DNA tiles can self-assemble a cellular-automaton pattern, a weaker relative of an atomic rule 110 computer" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.0020424> .
